### 2. `configs/slskd.service`
Since we spent so much time debugging the `slskd` systemd service, it is highly valuable to keep the *working* version in your repo as a reference. 

Create this file in your `configs/` folder:

```ini
[Unit]
Description=SoulSeek Daemon (slskd)
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=sambid
Group=sambid
# WorkingDirectory is critical for the relative contentPath in the YAML to resolve correctly
WorkingDirectory=/opt/slskd
ExecStart=/opt/slskd/slskd --no-logo -c /etc/slskd/slskd.yml
Restart=always
RestartSec=5
# Security hardening
NoNewPrivileges=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=true
ReadWritePaths=/home/sambid/Music/Soulseek

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
